00:32:44.030 --> 00:33:01.395
Querying: which requests failed in inventory, and what was the error? structured JSON: filter level=ERROR AND service=inventory, then 33 events, each with. traceid, userid, sku, error. unstructured: grep 'inventory' grep 'ERROR', then parse free text.

