00:33:03.406 --> 00:33:24.121
Fri Sep 25 23:19:27 IST 2026 inventory ERROR request failed for user u876 sku. sku-31 - timeout calling payme. then structured logs are queryable by field; text logs force brittle regex and can't. be aggregated reliably.

